OL,3,GNEWSAJudge rejects legal challenge to
OL,4,ACaerphilly library closures
OL,5,
OL,6,FTen of Caerphilly council's libraries
OL,7,Fare set to close after a High Court
OL,8,Fjudge dismissed a legal challenge from
OL,9,Fcampaigners.
OL,11,FThe Labour-run council plans to
OL,12,Fconcentrate library services in larger
OL,13,Ftowns, arguing that fewer, bigger sites
OL,14,Fwill be able to offer a wider range of
OL,15,Fservices.
OL,17,FSeven remaining branches would become
OL,18,Fmulti-service community hubs, where
OL,19,Fresidents could continue borrowing
OL,20,Fbooks alongside accessing other council
OL,21,Fservices.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,440,430,260,140,0,100
