OL,3,GNEWSAJudge rejects legal challenge to
OL,4,ACaerphilly library closures
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe judge rejected campaigners' attempt
OL,7,Fto halt the changes, although they may
OL,8,Fstill appeal against the ruling.
